<title>USA: GE unit says to buy healthcare assets.</title>
<headline>GE unit says to buy healthcare assets.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Medical Systems, a unit of General Electric Co, said on Monday it had agreed to acquire the U.S. healthcare assets of Specialty Underwriters Inc and Maintenance Management Corp, two private companies.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
